   "prompt": "Some alternative medicine practitioners recommend chelation treatments for ailments that are not clearly related to heavy metals, such as cancer and autism, although the practice is discouraged by many scientific organizations.<sup>1</sup> Identify at least two biologically important metals that could be disrupted by chelation therapy.<br><small><sup>1</sup> National Council against Health Fraud, <em>NCAHF Policy Statement on Chelation Therapy</em>, (Peabody, MA, 2002).</small>",
