   },
   "cite": "isomerism",
   "prompt": "Sketch the structures of the following complexes. Indicate any <em>cis</em>, <em>trans</em>, and optical isomers.<br>(a) [Pt(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>2</sub>Br<sub>2</sub>] (square planar)<br>(b) [Pt(NH<sub>3</sub>)(py)(Cl)(Br)] (square planar, py = pyridine, C<sub>5</sub>H<sub>5</sub>N)<br>(c) [Zn(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>Cl]<sup>+</sup> (tetrahedral)<br>(d) [Pt(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>Cl]<sup>+</sup> (square planar)<br>(e) [Ni(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>4</sub>Cl<sub>2</sub>]<br>(f) [Co(C<sub>2</sub>O<sub>4</sub>)<sub>2</sub>Cl<sub>2</sub>]<sup>3−</sup> (note that ${\\text{C}}_{2}{\\text{O}}_{4}{}^{2−}$ is the bidentate oxalate ion, $-{\\text{O}}_{2}{\\text{CCO}}_{2}{}^{\\text{−}})$",
   "answer": {
    "type": "open",
    "generated_by": "source",
